(Interviewee: David Wright, Subcontractor / Maintenance Technician) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([11:00 AM] REED: State your name and affiliation.) Tj T*
([11:00 AM] WRIGHT: David Wright. I am an independent electrical contractor) Tj T*
(working on assignment for Apex Solutions at Meridian Tech.) Tj T*
([11:01 AM] REED: What was your assignment on the night of October 12?) Tj T*
([11:01 AM] WRIGHT: I was contracted to test circuit breakers and emergency) Tj T*
(lighting on Floor 3 and in the basement utility hallway.) Tj T*
([11:02 AM] REED: What time did you arrive and leave Building 4?) Tj T*
([11:02 AM] WRIGHT: I got there around 8:30 PM. I finished my electrical) Tj T*
(maintenance and left Building 4 at 10:00 PM sharp. I drove straight home.) Tj T*
([11:03 AM] REED: Did you enter Server Room B?) Tj T*
([11:03 AM] WRIGHT: No way. The door to Server Room B was locked and marked) Tj T*
(restricted. I didn't have the badge access for it anyway.) Tj T*
([11:04 AM] REED: Did you see Bob Chen or Alice Vance during your shift?) Tj T*
([11:04 AM] WRIGHT: I saw Alice at her computer on Floor 3 around 9:40 PM. And) Tj T*
(I saw Bob leave his lanyard and keycard on the breakroom table around 9:45 PM) Tj T*
(when he went down to get takeout. It was sitting right there next to the) Tj T*
(coffee machine.) Tj T*
([11:05 AM] REED: Did you touch Bob's lanyard or keycard?) Tj T*
([11:05 AM] WRIGHT: No, I didn't touch it. I just noticed it sitting on the) Tj T*
(table.) Tj T*
([11:06 AM] REED: Understood. Thank you, Mr. Wright.) Tj T*
